 "remarks": "Whether you're looking for your first home, a renovation project, or your next investment opportunity, this charming 2-bedroom home is full of potential. Featuring hardwood floors, a cozy fireplace, and a spacious sunroom filled with natural light, the home offers a wonderful foundation to create something truly special. Additional highlights include a full basement, large attic for storage, attached garage, fully paid-for solar panels, and a newer gas boiler for added efficiency and peace of mind.  Bring your imagination and transform this home into your dream residence, or take advantage of its excellent investment potential. Ideally located in a walkable neighborhood just steps from Glenbrook's shops, restaurants, and Metro-North train station, with quick access to I-95 (Exit 9), this home combines convenience, character, and opportunity in one desirable package. **HIGHEST AND BEST OFFERS DUE THURSDAY 8/6 AT 5PM**",
